Houston, if you watched Manuel Ángel Redondo’s new crowdwork special, *Hablando sucio*, you know the room is part of the show.

@manuelangelr brings written stand-up and real-time crowdwork to Punch Line Houston. His comedy gets personal—migration, family, love, and the strange work of adjusting to a new place. I’d see this one live. 🎤

Punch Line Houston · Tuesday, October 6, 2026

